\description{
Wraps \verb{GET https://www.shl.se/api/statistics-v2/stats-info/\{module\}} of the SHL site API
(www.shl.se). Unofficial use of a public source; seasons are END years (2026 = 2025/26) and are
mapped to the site's ssgt uuids through \verb{/statistics-v2/layout-info}.
}
\section{Errors}{

\code{fastRhockey_no_data}: the host answered 404, an empty body (gameday routes before 2023/24), a
table with no rows, or the season and game type are not in layout-info. \code{fastRhockey_asset_fetch}:
any other non-2xx answer or a dead connection after retries, a non-JSON or error-envelope 200, a
stats-info page that reaches \code{count} or falls short of its \code{totalCount}, or a body for another
game, team, athlete or ssgt than the one asked for. \code{fastRhockey_bad_request}: a 400 / 422, a
season that is not a year, or an argument outside its choices.
}

\examples{
\donttest{
  shl_stats_info(module = "players_summary", season = 2026)
}
}
